    schema: 38 .xsd beside the dtd/, same specializations in XML Schema
    catalog: catalog.xml plus plugin.xml at root

dual-grammar-maintenance:
    > DTD and XSD maintained side by side for the same specializations:
    > 36 DTD-side files against 38 schema files. Neither is generated from
    > the other here, which is exactly the hand-kept pair the ODD
    > discipline exists to replace. The corpus's only maintained-in-parallel
    > pair at this size.

release-binding:
